      "seed": 1068,
      "text": "Uncommitted on main: the detection retune and the new PitchTracker that owns acquisition, smoothing, and expiry.\nOn the October 13 guitar recording, matching windows went 12.9% → 90.6% (G3), 3.2% → 89.2% (B3),\n46.1% → 92.2% (E4). Details in docs/detection-validation.md — the live-device retest is still pending.",
      "originalText": "Uncommitted on main: the detection retune and the new PitchTracker that owns acquisition, smoothing, and expiry.\nOn the October 13 guitar recording, matching windows went 12.9% → 90.6% (G3), 3.2% → 89.2% (B3),\n46.1% → 92.2% (E4). Details in docs/detection-validation.md — the live-device retest is still pending.",
